{"script":"wt_c4_08_1_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"索洛罗哆","text":"[show]你们……们手上没有松茸汤啊噗……是、是、是不是记错了噗。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"索洛罗哆","text":"[show]我、我、我需要一碗美味的松茸鲜汤噗……只要、只要一碗就好噗……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"索洛罗哆","text":"[show]拜、拜、拜托你们了噗！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"为了友谊传递的鲜香"}